              modules yields a projective class.
          .num_example
            %h6#example_4 Example
            %p
              Given a pair of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjoint+functors"} adjoint functors
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi F
                    %mo ⊣
                    %mi U
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo :
